" *ngIf="!editable" test-id="removeRmaDetailsClick" (click)="confirmRemove()">Remove</a></small></li>\n\t\t</ul>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class="col-8" *ngIf="editable">\n\t\t<form #rmaItemForm="ngForm" (ngSubmit)="addToRma()">\n\t\t\t<div class="row">\n\t\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-6">\n\t\t\t\t\t<mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<input test-id="projectName" matInput type="text" name="project" placeholder="Project Name" list="projectsList"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   [(ngModel)]="item.project" [disabled]="!editable" required />\n\t\t\t\t\t</mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t\t<datalist id="projectsList">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<option *ngFor="let p of projects" [value]="p">\n\t\t\t\t\t</datalist>\n\t\t\t\t\t<select test-id="isDeadOnArrival" name="doa" [(ngModel)]="item.deadOnArrival" [disabled]="!editable" required>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<option disabled value="">Defective Out of Box?</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value="Dead">Yes</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value="NotDead">No</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t</select>\n\t\t\t\t\t<select test-id="selectedSymptom" name="symptom" [(ngModel)]="item.selectedSymptom" [disabled]="!editable" required>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<option disabled [value]="undefined">Select Symptom</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<optgroup *ngFor="let group of item.symptomList | groupBy:\'header\'" [label]="group.key">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option *ngFor="let item of group.value" [ngValue]="item">{{item.symptom}}</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</optgroup>\n\t\t\t\t\t</select>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class="row">\n\t\t\t\t<div class="col-12">\n\t\t\t\t\t<textarea test-id="itemIssues" name="description" placeholder="Describe the issue and troubleshooting performed"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  [(ngModel)]="item.description" required></textarea>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class="row">\n\t\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-6">\n\t\t\t\t\t<select test-id="selectedResolution" name="resolution" [(ngModel)]="item.resolution" [disabled]="!editable" required>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<option disabled [value]="undefined">Select Desired Resolution</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<option *ngFor="let r of item.resolutionOptions" [ngValue]="r">{{r.displayValue}}</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t</select>\n\t\t\t\t\t<button test-id="addToRmaClick" class="grey" [disabled]="!rmaItemForm.form.valid"><i class="fal fa-check"></i>Add To RMA</button>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</form>\n\t</div>\n</div>'},km5F:function(t,e){t.exports='<div class="padding">\n\t<h1>Request RMA Return Label</h1>\n\t<div class="alert alert-warning" *ngIf="loaded && rmaItems.length <= 0">\n\t\t<p>This RMA does not contain any items that qualify for the return label feature.</p>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class="alert alert-warning" *ngIf="loaded && !rmaQualified">\n\t\t<p>This RMA includes items which are no longer covered under warranty and do not qualify for a return shipping label.</p>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class="widget" *ngIf="requestComplete">\n\t\t<h3 class="widget-header-white">Confirmation</h3>\n\t\t<div class="padding">\n\t\t\t<p>Your RMA shipping label request has been approved. Please proceed as follows:</p>\n\t\t\t<ol>\n\t\t\t\t<li>Print each of the return labels using the Shipping Label information below.</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>Carefully package the equipment to be returned -- credit will not be issued for items damaged during shipment.</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li *ngIf="!isEmea">Ship the equipment by arranging collection from FedEx or dropping off the package at a FedEx drop-off location. Note that\n\t\t\t\t\titems may be shipped to different Control4 warehouses. <ol type="a">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>If arranging collection via FedEx pickup, please contact <no-br>{{fedexContactNumber}} </no-br> and use Option 1, Option 2 (customer\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tservices).</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>If using a FedEx drop-off location, use the drop-off location locator <a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   href="https://www.fedex.com/locate/index.html" target="_blank">here</a>.</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t</ol>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li *ngIf="isEmea"> Ship the equipment by arranging collection from FedEx. Note that items may be shipped to different Control4 warehouses. <ol\n\t\t\t\t\t\ttype="a">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>To arrange collection over the phone, please contact <no-br>{{fedexContactNumber}}</no-br> and use Option 1, Option 2 (customer\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tservices).</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>To arrange collection online, schedule your return shipment <a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   href="http://www.fedex.com/gb/shipping-services/global-returns/schedule-return-shipment.html"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   target="_blank">here</a>.</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t</ol>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t</ol>\n\t\t\t<p>Please contact our Technical Support team at {{supportNumber}} with questions or concerns.</p>\n\t\t\t<h3>Shipping Label<span *ngIf="returnLabels.length > 1">s</span></h3>\n\t\t\t<div class="table">\n\t\t\t\t<div class="body">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="row" *ngFor="let label of returnLabels">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-6">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a [href]="label.returnLabelUrl" [title]="label.returnLabelUrl" target="_blank"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   class="overridelegal"><i class="fal fa-print"></i>Print {{label.returnLocation}} Shipping Label</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br /><small *ngIf="label.trackingNumber">Tracking Number: {{label.trackingNumber}}</small>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-6">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class="no-style">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li *ngFor="let item of rmaItems.filter(filterItems(label.returnLocationFlags))"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass="text-right">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<small>{{item.productName}}<span\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  *ngIf="item.productName">&mdash;</span>{{item.macAddress}}</small>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class="row no-margin">\n\t\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-2">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a routerLink="/rma" class="c4btn dark-grey block"><i class="fal fa-arrow-left"></i>Return to RMA History</a>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class="widget" *ngIf="!requestComplete">\n\t\t<h3 class="widget-header-white">Dealer Information</h3>\n\t\t<div class="padding">\n\t\t\t<c4-loading *ngIf="!loaded"></c4-loading>\n\t\t\t<div class="row" *ngIf="loaded && rmaInformation">\n\t\t\t\t<div class="col-lg-4 col-sm-6">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class="bold no-margin">{{rmaInformation.contactCompany}} &mdash; {{rmaInformation.contactName}} </p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p> {{rmaInformation.contactEmail}}<br /> {{rmaInformation.contactPhone}} </p>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class="widget" *ngIf="!requestComplete">\n\t\t<h3 class="widget-header-white">Return Shipping Address</h3>\n\t\t<div class="padding">\n\t\t\t<c4-loading *ngIf="!loaded"></c4-loading>\n\t\t\t<form name="senderForm" (ngSubmit)="requestReturnLabel()" *ngIf="loaded" #senderForm="ngForm">\n\t\t\t\t<div class="row">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-lg-4 col-sm-6 d-xs-none">Address 1</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-lg-8 col-sm-6">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input test-id="address1" matInput type="text" name="addressLine1" placeholder="Address 1"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   [(ngModel)]="shippingAddress.line1" required>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class="row">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-lg-4 col-sm-6 d-xs-none">Address 2</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-lg-8 col-sm-6">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input test-id="address2" matInput type="text" name="addressLine2" placeholder="Address 2"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   [(ngModel)]="shippingAddress.line2">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class="row">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-lg-4 col-sm-6 d-xs-none">City</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-lg-8 col-sm-6">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input test-id="city" matInput type="text" name="city" placeholder="City"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   [(ngModel)]="shippingAddress.city" required>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class="row">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-lg-4 col-sm-6 d-xs-none">State</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-lg-8 col-sm-6">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<select test-id="selectedState" name="state" [(ngModel)]="selectedState" required>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option [value]="undefined">State</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option *ngFor="let s of selectedCountry?.states" [ngValue]="s">{{s.displayValue}}</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</select>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class="row">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-lg-4 col-sm-6 d-xs-none">Postal Code</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-lg-8 col-sm-6">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input test-id="postalCode" matInput type="text" name="zip" placeholder="Zip"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   [(ngModel)]="shippingAddress.postalCode" required>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class="row">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-lg-4 col-sm-6 d-xs-none">Country</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-lg-8 col-sm-6">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<select test-id="selectedCountry" name="country" [ngModel]="selectedCountry" (ngModelChange)="countrySelected($event)"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\trequired>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option [value]="undefined">Country</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option *ngFor="let s of countries.countries" [ngValue]="s">{{s.displayValue}}</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</select>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class="row">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-lg-4 col-sm-6 d-xs-none">Phone</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-lg-8 col-sm-6">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input test-id="phone" matInput type="text" name="phone" placeholder="Phone" [(ngModel)]="phone"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   [disabled]="requestingLabels || rmaItems.length <= 0" required>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class="row">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-lg-4 col-sm-6 d-xs-none">Email</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-lg-8 col-sm-6">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input test-id="email" matInput type="text" name="email" placeholder="Email" [(ngModel)]="email"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   [disabled]="requestingLabels || rmaItems.length <= 0" required>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class="row">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-lg-4 col-sm-6 d-xs-none">Number of Packages</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-lg-8 col-sm-6">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input test-id="numberOfPackages" matInput type="number" name="amount" placeholder="Number of Packages"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   [(ngModel)]="numberOfPackages" min="1" required>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class="row" *ngIf="!senderForm.form.valid && !returnContainsCLT">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="offset-lg-4 col-lg-8 offset-sm-6 col-sm-6">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class="alert alert-warning" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">Please fill in all required fields.</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class="row" *ngIf="returnContainsCLT">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="offset-lg-4 col-lg-8 offset-sm-6 col-sm-6">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class="alert alert-warning" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">This request contains an item that cannot be returned through this form.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPlease contact us for an RMA for this item.</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class="row" *ngIf="rmaQualified">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="offset-lg-4 col-lg-8 offset-sm-6 col-sm-6">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<button test-id="requestRmaLabelClick" type="submit"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t[disabled]="requestingLabels || rmaItems.length <= 0 || !senderForm.form.valid || returnContainsCLT">Request RMA Label</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</form>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class="widget" *ngIf="!requestComplete">\n\t\t<h3 class="widget-header-white">RMA Item Details</h3>\n\t\t<div class="padding">\n\t\t\t<c4-loading *ngIf="!loaded"></c4-loading>\n\t\t\t<div *ngIf="loaded">\n\t\t\t\t<p *ngIf="rmaItems.length <= 0">This RMA does not contain any items that qualify for the return label feature.</p>\n\t\t\t\t<div class="table">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="head d-xs-none">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class="row">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-3">MAC Address</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-3">Product</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-3">Problem</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-3">Resolution</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="body">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class="row" *ngFor="let rma of rmaItems">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-3 col-6">{{rma.macAddress}}</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-3 col-6">{{rma.productName}}</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-3 col-6">{{rma.symptom}}</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-3 col-6">{{rma.resolution}}</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>'},vgAf:function(t,e){t.exports='<div class="padding">\n\t<div class="row no-margin">\n\t\t<div class="col-sm-9 half-padding-bottom" [ngClass]="(canSubmitRmas$ | async) ? \'col-sm-9\': \'col-sm-12\'">\n\t\t\t<h1>Return Merchandise Authorization</h1>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class="col-sm-3" *ngIf="canSubmitRmas$ | async">\n\t\t\t<a routerLink="/rma/submit" [skipLocationChange]="true" class="c4btn block">Create New RMA</a>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<form class="dark" (ngSubmit)="search()">\n\t\t<div class="row no-margin">\n\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-2 no-margin">\n\t\t\t\t<div class="placeholder-wrapper">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="placeholder-text">Case Number</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<input test-id="caseNumber" matInput type="text" placeholder="Case Number" name="caseNumber"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   [(ngModel)]="searchArgs.caseNumber">\n\t\t\t\t\t</mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-5 no-margin">\n\t\t\t\t<div class="placeholder-wrapper">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="placeholder-text">Subject</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<input test-id="searchSubject" matInput type="text" placeholder="Subject" name="subject"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   [(ngModel)]="searchArgs.subject">\n\t\t\t\t\t</mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-2 col-4">\n\t\t\t\t<mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t\t<input test-id="startDate" matInput type="date" placeholder="Start Date" name="startDate"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t   [(ngModel)]="searchArgs.startDate">\n\t\t\t\t</mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-2 col-4">\n\t\t\t\t<mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t\t\t<input test-id="endDate" matInput type="date" placeholder="End Date" name="endDate" [(ngModel)]="searchArgs.endDate">\n\t\t\t\t</mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class="col-sm-1 col-4">\n\t\t\t\t<button test-id="searchRmaHistoryClick" type="submit" class="block grey"><i class="fal fa-search"></i></button>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</form>\n\t<div class="widget">\n\t\t<h3 class="widget-header-white">Requested RMAs</h3>\n\t\t<div class="padding">\n\t\t\t<c4-loading *ngIf="searching"></c4-loading>\n\t\t\t<p *ngIf="rmas?.length == 0 && !searching">No RMA records found.</p>\n\t\t\t<div class="table no-margin" *ngIf="rmas?.length > 0">\n\t\t\t\t<div class="body">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class="row" *ngFor="let rma of rmas">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-md-2 col-6 order-md-1">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class="no-margin">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class="bold">{{rma.caseNumber}}</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<small class="block">Case Number</small>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-md-2 col-6 order-md-3 text-right">{{rma.createdDate | date:\'MMM dd, yyyy\' }} <small class="block">Created</small>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-md-4 order-md-2">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class="block truncate">{{rma.subject}}</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<small class="block">Subject</small>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class="no-style" *ngIf="rma.showLabel">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li *ngFor="let label of rma.returnLabels">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a [href]="label.returnLabelUrl" [title]="label.returnLabelUrl" target="_blank"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   class="block overridelegal"><i class="fal fa-print"></i>Shipping Label {{label.returnLocationDisplayValue}} </a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<small *ngIf="label.trackingNumber">Tracking Number <a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   href="https://www.fedex.com/fedextrack/?trknbr={{label.trackingNumber}}"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   target="_blank" class="text-grey overridelegal">{{label.trackingNumber}}</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</small>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class="col-md-3 order-md-4 offset-md-1">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ng-container *ngIf="isInternationalEmea$ | async">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class="c4btn grey block no-margin"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   href="http://supportsurvey.control4.com/r/wYwwG6Hq/" target="_blank"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   *ngIf="isGermanDealer$ | async">Request Shipping Label(s)</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class="c4btn grey block no-margin"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   href="https://forms.cloud.microsoft/r/ZxWdA327zi" target="_blank"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   *ngIf="!(isGermanDealer$ | async)">Request Shipping Label(s)</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ng-container>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class="c4btn grey block no-margin" href="http://supportsurvey.control4.com/r/HbsdwaPF"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   target="_blank" *ngIf="isAustralia$ | async">Request Shipping Label(s)</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class="c4btn grey block no-margin" routerLink="/rma/returnlabel/{{rma.id}}"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   [skipLocationChange]="true"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   *ngIf="!(isInternationalEmea$  |async) && !(isAustralia$ | async) && !rma.hasLabel">Request Shipping Label(s)</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class="c4btn light-grey text-dark block no-margin" href="javascript:;"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   *ngIf="rma.hasLabel" (click)="getReturnLabelInfo(rma)">View Shipping Label(s)</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class="text-right" *ngIf="rma.showLabel"><small>Expired label? <a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   routerLink="/rma/returnlabel/{{rma.id}}" [skipLocationChange]="true">Request New Label</a></small></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class="pagination" *ngIf="pagingInfo.total">\n\t\t\t\t\t<c4-pager [info]="pagingInfo" (infoChange)="updatePage($event)"></c4-pager>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class="row">\n\t\t<div class="col-sm-8">\n\t\t\t<div class="widget">\n\t\t\t\t<h3 class="widget-header-white">RMA Procedure</h3>\n\t\t\t\t<div class="padding" *ngIf="brandName$ | async as companyName">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Follow these steps whenever you think you need to return a product:</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Call while on the customer\'s site if possible at {{supportNumber}}. Only a {{companyName}} Tech Support Representative can issue an\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAdvanced Replacement or Repair RMA.</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Troubleshooting is required before the RMA can be processed. {{companyName}} Tech Support will assist you with this process. Note:\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThe Dealer\'s employee who contacts {{companyName}} Tech Support for an RMA must be Tech I or Installer certified.</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>{{companyName}} will cover inbound and outbound freight costs for defective RMA\'s while under product warranty.</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>If there is a repair kit available, {{companyName}} will ship the kit before issuing an RMA to replace or repair the device.</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Product warranties (CI only):</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li> Warranty advance replacement: <ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Two (2) years from the ship date on all {{companyName}} A-stock products.</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>One (1) year from the ship date on all {{companyName}} B-stock products.</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>For products needing replacement during the 2nd year of product warranty, {{companyName}} will provide an advance replacement\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tfactory reconditioned product.</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li> New RMA policy\u2014effective January 19, 2017 <br> Dealer accounts will be charged 25% for RMA\u2019s that get shipped backed after 45 days\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tand 50% for shipments after 90 days the date the RMA was initiated. After 120 days the RMA tag is cancelled and will not be\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taccepted. </li>\n\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Third-party distribution partners, such as Sony, Black & Decker, Yale, and Current Audio, warranties and troubleshooting:</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>The partner is responsible for any hardware troubleshooting.</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>{{companyName}} Tech Support will troubleshoot any {{companyName}}-certified integrated device for {{companyName}} integration.</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>The RMA will be processed by the partner. Repair or replacement will follow the partner\'s own policies. </li>\n\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class="col-sm-4">\n\t\t\t<div class="widget">\n\t\t\t\t<h3 class="widget-header-white">Bulk RMAs</h3>\n\t\t\t\t<div class="padding">\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>{{brandName$ | async}} does not accept bulk RMAs.</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Bulk RMAs received will always be processed as \'repair\' only. No credit or replacement is available. </li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Bulk RMAs are defined as three (3) to five (5) devices or more.</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n'},yPVW:function(t,e){t.exports=""}}]);